---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { IMPACTS } from '../consts';
---

<section class="section bg-brand-blue text-white">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
      <div class="eyebrow text-brand-yellow">DAMPAK BERGANDA</div>
      <h2 class="text-heading-sm md:text-heading-lg font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-4">Satu Aksi. Banyak Dampak.</h2>
      <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-white/85">
        <strong>Sekali berbagi, dampaknya menjangkau jauh melampaui penerima bantuan.</strong> Satu donasi turut menghidupkan UMKM sekitar, menciptakan lapangan kerja, dan mempererat ikatan warga.
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* Cascade: satu donasi (seed) memancar ke empat dampak. Bentuk aliran
        menegaskan "berganda" — bukan empat kotak setara yang datar. */}
    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center gap-7 lg:gap-6">
      <div class="flex-none mx-auto lg:mx-0 w-32 h-32 md:w-36 md:h-36 rounded-full bg-brand-yellow text-ink flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center">
        <span class="text-eyebrow font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink/55">mulai</span>
        <span class="text-title font-extrabold leading-tight mt-0.5">Satu<br />Donasi</span>
      </div>

      <div aria-hidden="true" class="flex-none self-center text-white/40">
        <svg class="rotate-90 lg:rotate-0" width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg>
      </div>

      <div class="flex-1 grid gap-x-6 gap-y-7 sm:grid-cols-2">
        {IMPACTS.map((im) => (
          <div class="flex gap-4" data-fade="1">
            <span class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-white/15 flex items-center justify-center flex-none">
              <Icon name={im.icon} color="white" size={20} />
            </span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-title-sm font-bold mb-1">{im.title}</h3>
              <p class="text-body-sm leading-snug text-white/80">{im.desc}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="border-t border-white/20 mt-11 pt-6 text-center text-body-sm leading-relaxed">
      <strong>Ekonomi kebaikan yang berputar lokal:</strong> dana dari donatur dibelanjakan ke UMKM setempat, dikerjakan warga setempat, dan dinikmati penerima yang tepat.
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
